{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼經常申請一些頗具野心的專利，不過這一次的想法可能更貼近現實。據Patentlyze發現，索尼互動娛樂於11月19日公佈的一項專利申請，描述了一種專用的手柄按鍵，可以讓遊戲在畫質模式和性能模式之間即時切換。用户不必每次都進入設置菜單，只需按下這個按鍵，就能在預設之間來回切換。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588134.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.869356+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"e4bab6458d35afd7101cc14909805f39bc31192a4d9b960b88e9f88d3c7d487f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}